# .gitignore — courses-academy
# Content repo (YAML, Markdown, images, exercise sources); there is no app
# build here. Every entry exists because that byproduct class has actually
# appeared in or around this tree — keep it that way, no generic templates.

# --- macOS / editor noise --------------------------------------------------
# AppleDouble (._*) copies appear when assets move across volumes/AirDrop.
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
*~

# --- local env & secrets ----------------------------------------------------
# A real .env (MCP/API keys) lives untracked at the repo root. Only the
# example template may ever be committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Keypairs generated while test-deploying course programs (twins, exercise
# crates). Deliberately narrow: a *.json glob here would also swallow
# tests.json and IDLs, which are course content.
*-keypair.json

# --- agent / session scratch -------------------------------------------------
# Sessions litter the root with scratch dirs (.tmplint/tsx-501 happened) and
# in-repo worktrees under .claude/worktrees/. Claude/plugin local state is
# machine-local; versioning any of it is a deliberate act — edit this file
# first if that day comes.
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
.agents/
.memsearch/
.superpowers/
.tmp*/

# local course-production staging (agent output; never commit directly)
academy-pass1/
academy-raw/

# --- Node / TypeScript -------------------------------------------------------
# Lessons carry ts/ and exercise/ workspaces; contributors run `npm i` inside
# them to verify solutions. node_modules/ matches at any depth. No lockfile
# is tracked anywhere in this repo — they are verification byproducts.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Rust ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Building twin programs or lesson exercise crates in place drops target/ and
# a Cargo.lock; neither is ever content. Generalized from the PR #44 pattern
# courses/mastering-anchor-v2/twins/**/target/.
target/
Cargo.lock

# --- Python (scripts/) ---------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# --- logs & interrupted-tool leftovers -------------------------------------------
# *.tmp: cwebp/sips asset-conversion runs cut short; *.orig / *.rej: mergetool
# backups and failed patch hunks from the PR merge train.
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# --- tracked on purpose — never add patterns that match these ---------------------
# courses/*/visual-src/      HTML render sources. Never published, but tracked
#                            so lesson figures can be regenerated.
# courses/*/slots.lock.json  Pins on-chain bitmap positions. CI regenerates it
#                            and fails on any diff — it must stay tracked.
